  <data name="CommandLine_Help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>smarcivaZIP - a simple archiver

Usage:
  SmarcivaZip.exe &lt;archive&gt;                   extract it
  SmarcivaZip.exe --extract &lt;archive&gt;         extract next to the archive
  SmarcivaZip.exe --extract-to-folder &lt;archive&gt;
                                              extract into a new folder
  SmarcivaZip.exe --extract-preview &lt;archive&gt;
                                              confirm the encoding, then extract
  SmarcivaZip.exe --compress &lt;format&gt; &lt;path...&gt;
                                              compress (formats: zip, 7z, tar.gz, ...)
  SmarcivaZip.exe --compress &lt;format&gt; --password &lt;path...&gt;
                                              compress with a password
  SmarcivaZip.exe --settings                  open the settings window
  SmarcivaZip.exe --register                  register associations and the context menu
  SmarcivaZip.exe --unregister                remove them</value>
  </data>
